17. Adverse reactions to prior anti-tumor therapy have not recovered to Grade ≤ 1 as per CTCAE Ver 5.0 (except for toxicities that are judged by the investigator to have no safety risk, such as alopecia, Grade 2 peripheral neurotoxicity, hypothyroidism which is stable after hormone replacement therapy, etc.);
