9. Received any drug within 14 days before taking the investigational drug;
10. Received any drugs that inhibit or induce the CYP450 enzyme (i.e., inducers- barbiturates, tegretol, phenytoin, rifampicin, hexadecadrol, rifabutin, rifapentini; inhibitors- SSRI-antidepressant, cimetidine, diltiazem, macrolides, verapamil, imidazoles- antifungal drugs) 30 days prior to screening period；
